<section class="nk-hero"><div class="nk-hero-i pxw"><img data-px=".14" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767050292710-8e5da59ec5d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&h=1200&q=75" alt="an elegant dinner table set with flowers and gold cutlery" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="nk-hero-c"><div class="nk-fold" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p class="nk-ey">The art of the table</p><h1>Napkins</h1><p class="nk-hero-p"><em>An independent guide to folding, placing and caring for the humblest, most elegant thing at dinner.</em></p><a class="nk-btn" href="#folds">Open the fold library</a></div><p class="nk-hero-s" aria-hidden="true">Scroll</p></section>

<section class="nk-s nk-in"><div class="nk-w nk-in-c"><p class="nk-ey">An overture</p><p class="nk-drop rv">A napkin is the first thing a guest touches and the last thing they leave behind. Folded with care, it tells everyone at the table that the evening has been thought about, long before the first course arrives.</p><div class="nk-in-n stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="50">50</b><span>cm square, the classic dinner napkin</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="5">5</b><span>folds every host should know</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="1">1</b><span>place for it: on the plate, or to the left</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="nk-hz" id="linen"><div class="nk-hz-st"><div class="nk-w nk-hz-h"><p class="nk-ey">The linen room</p><h2>Five notes on cloth</h2></div><div class="nk-hz-t" id="hz-t"><div class="nk-hz-c"><div class="nk-hz-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596433904500-97b901c5d274?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=760&q=75" alt="white linen napkins on a wooden table" width="620" height="760" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>&#8470; 1</span>Natural linen</p><small>Softens with every wash and creases beautifully.</small></div><div class="nk-hz-c"><div class="nk-hz-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705290304352-4beef0b626b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=760&q=75" alt="close-up of a dark linen napkin with a stitched hem" width="620" height="760" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>&#8470; 2</span>The hemstitch</p><small>A drawn-thread border, the mark of fine table linen.</small></div><div class="nk-hz-c"><div class="nk-hz-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596433904747-e8b061219a71?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=760&q=75" alt="green and white napkins folded on a wooden board" width="620" height="760" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>&#8470; 3</span>Colour and check</p><small>Gingham and stripes for relaxed suppers.</small></div><div class="nk-hz-c"><div class="nk-hz-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705290304455-35ffb433f560?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=760&q=75" alt="close-up of a folded linen cloth" width="620" height="760" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>&#8470; 4</span>The weight</p><small>Heavier linen folds crisply and drapes on the lap.</small></div><div class="nk-hz-c"><div class="nk-hz-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1632996547902-064471618ef0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=760&q=75" alt="a white plate with small flowers on a linen napkin" width="620" height="760" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>&#8470; 5</span>The finishing touch</p><small>A sprig of herbs or a flower tucked into the fold.</small></div></div><div class="nk-w"><div class="nk-hz-bar"><i id="hz-b"></i></div></div></div></section>

<section class="nk-s nk-fl" id="folds"><div class="nk-w nk-fl-g"><div class="nk-fl-l"><p class="nk-ey">The fold library</p><h2 class="rv">Fold along, step by step</h2><div class="nk-fl-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Napkin folds"></div><figure class="nk-fl-ph rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1766002156650-6e18ef2acbef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=420&q=75" alt="chopsticks holding a cloth napkin rolled into a rose" width="620" height="420" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="nk-fl-r"><div class="nk-fl-st"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" id="fl-svg" aria-hidden="true"></svg><span class="nk-fl-n" id="fl-n">1 / 4</span></div><h3 id="fl-h"></h3><p id="fl-p" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="nk-fl-b"><button type="button" id="fl-prev" class="nk-rb" aria-label="Previous step">&larr;</button><button type="button" id="fl-next" class="nk-rb" aria-label="Next step">&rarr;</button></div></div></div></section>

<section class="nk-qt"><div class="nk-qt-i pxw"><img data-px=".12" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1768508949122-040d9ac82032?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&h=900&q=75" alt="a formal table setting with a floral centrepiece" width="1800" height="900" loading="lazy"></div><blockquote class="nk-w"><p class="rv">Lay the table as if the guests were already seated.</p><cite>An old host&rsquo;s rule</cite></blockquote></section>

<section class="nk-s nk-ps" id="setting"><div class="nk-w"><div class="nk-cen"><p class="nk-ey">Place setting builder</p><h2 class="rv">Choose the courses, see the setting</h2><p class="nk-p">Cutlery is laid from the outside in, in the order it is used. Pick tonight&rsquo;s courses.</p></div><div class="nk-ps-g rv"><div class="nk-ps-c" role="group" aria-label="Courses"><label><input type="checkbox" value="st" checked><span>Starter</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" value="so"><span>Soup</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" value="ma" checked disabled><span>Main course</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" value="de" checked><span>Dessert</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" value="br"><span>Bread</span></label></div><div class="nk-ps-t"><svg viewBox="0 0 600 340" id="ps-svg" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div><p class="nk-ps-o" id="ps-o" aria-live="polite"></p></div><figure class="nk-ps-ph rv rv-w"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1757625487036-1f9ad7f70289?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=600&q=75" alt="a table setting with a napkin ring and autumn decorations" width="1400" height="600" loading="lazy"></figure></div></section>

<section class="nk-gl"><a class="nk-gl-a" href="napkin-folding-guide.html"><div class="nk-gl-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758810742974-b92459867642?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=640&q=75" alt="an outdoor dining table set with flowers" width="900" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nk-gl-t"><span>The first guide</span><b>Napkin Folds</b><em>Five folds, from the simple rectangle to the rose.</em></div></a><a class="nk-gl-a" href="dinner-table-setting-guide.html"><div class="nk-gl-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758705477576-8783430d55b6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=640&q=75" alt="a decorated table setting with a lit candle and flowers" width="900" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nk-gl-t"><span>The second guide</span><b>Setting the Table</b><em>Cutlery, glasses and napkins, all in their places.</em></div></a></section>

